### F1 — paginated pet list (response should contain "content")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pets?page=0&size=10&sort=name,asc
Accept: application/json

### F1 — selected pet details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pets/2001
Accept: application/json

### Legacy CRUD — create pet (ownerId must reference an existing owner)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "microchipNumber": "MC-9001",
  "name": "Testy",
  "species": "Dog",
  "breed": "Mixed",
  "age": 2,
  "ownerId": 1001
}
